From 4f8a7a4bd0d185a0296c1d721bef8e7b1e8d4a59 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: blazerpaul15 <blazerpaul15@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 18 Nov 2026 19:30:18 +0900
Subject: [PATCH] renderengine: Add Dolby Vision GPU color conversion

Use DolbyEffect 4.1 and QTI buffer metadata to restore native Dolby
colors during OpenGL composition, including blur and task capture.

Gate the adapter behind a device property, preserve existing HWC LUTs,
and retain the normal output color transform and dimming stages.

[EvoX: coexist with the in-tree DolbyVisionShader (liboplusdolbyeffect_5.0):
 run this DolbyEffect 4.1 adapter first and skip DolbyVisionShader for
 layers it already converted; include <renderengine/ColorSpaces.h>.]

Assisted-by: LLM
Change-Id: I33ee6a36b7ea21de0b724071b504eed8a7a2501a

